      "title": "Core",
      "description": "createAgentApi: OpenAPI 3.1 + Scalar docs, HAL links, problem+json, API keys + Access, ETags and Cache-Control, Idempotency-Key and rate limits, discovery (api-catalog, Link headers, robots.txt, Markdown for agents), a key-value store type, sortable ids (`newId`), long-poll waits (`waitFor`) and later work through a queue (`Jobs`: `queueJobs`, `memoryJobs`); an OAuth server plugs in from the `oauth` part",
      "dependencies": [
        "hono@^4.13.18",
        "@hono/zod-openapi@^1.6.3",
